      "notes": "Model year = NIK 2024 units, still listed in the January 2026 and October 2026 price lists. OTR Jakarta Rp1,841,000,000 (off-the-road Rp1,813,000,000); July 2024 list was Rp1,835,000,000 OTR. The bmw.co.id technical data page heads the data 'i4 eDrive40' but the figures (210 kW/286 hp, 400 Nm, 67.1 kWh) are the eDrive35's; the overview page quotes 205 kW DC which is the old eDrive40 figure, the technical page says 180 kW DC (41 min 10-80%). Battery 67.1 kWh is not labelled gross/net (matches BMW's net figure). Zigwheels lists 66 kWh, 490 km and 6.0 s. Range is the top of 406-500 km WLTP. Kerb weight is EC unladen. Boot 470-1,290 l. Gross battery (70.3 kWh), connectors, airbags and ADAS from the Malaysian spec (AutoBuzz, carbase.my); chemistry, voltage, charge port, V2L, frunk and heat pump from the European spec (ev-database.org).",
      "notes_id": "Tahun model = unit NIK 2024, masih tercantum di daftar harga Januari 2026 dan Oktober 2026. OTR Jakarta Rp1.841.000.000 (off-the-road Rp1.813.000.000); daftar Juli 2024 Rp1.835.000.000 OTR. Halaman data teknis bmw.co.id berjudul 'i4 eDrive40', tetapi angkanya (210 kW/286 hp, 400 Nm, 67,1 kWh) milik eDrive35; halaman ikhtisar menyebut DC 205 kW yang merupakan angka eDrive40 lama, sedangkan halaman teknis menyebut DC 180 kW (41 menit 10-80%). Baterai 67,1 kWh tidak diberi label gross/net (cocok dengan angka net BMW). Zigwheels mencantumkan 66 kWh, 490 km, dan 6,0 detik. Jarak tempuh diambil dari batas atas 406-500 km WLTP. Bobot kosong mengacu pada standar EC (unladen). Bagasi 470-1.290 l. Baterai gross (70,3 kWh), konektor, airbag, dan ADAS dari spesifikasi Malaysia (AutoBuzz, carbase.my); kimia baterai, tegangan, posisi port, V2L, frunk, dan heat pump dari spesifikasi Eropa (ev-database.org)."
